{"title":"Some Wild Ice Skating","link":"https://kottke.org/25/02/some-wild-ice-skating","date":1739153028000,"content":"\n        <p>When Fairlee, Vermont’s Lake Morey freezes over in the winter, a 4-5 mile loop is <a href=\"https://www.vermontpublic.org/local-news/2025-01-22/fairlee-takes-over-lake-morey-ice-skating-loop-vermont-tradition-lives-on\">cleared by a local resort</a> for wild ice skating. I was able to get out on the ice with my family for a couple hours on Friday; it was great fun, and I’m looking forward to going again soon.</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/wild-ice-morey-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/wild-ice-morey-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/wild-ice-morey-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2845\" alt=\"a frozen path on a snowy lake\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/wild-ice-morey-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/wild-ice-morey-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/wild-ice-morey-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1600\" alt=\"lake ice with cracks and marks from ice skates\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/wild-ice-morey-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/wild-ice-morey-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/wild-ice-morey-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2134\" alt=\"a man on a frozen path on a snowy lake\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/wild-ice-morey-04.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/wild-ice-morey-04.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/wild-ice-morey-04.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1600\" alt=\"lake ice with cracks and a spiral pattern\" /></p>\n\n<p>I hope you got out this weekend and did something outside or active or new or comforting…we’re going to need to replenish our reserves in the coming weeks and months.</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Jason%20Kottke\">Jason Kottke</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/skating\">skating</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/sports\">sports</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/02/some-wild-ice-skating\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"efdd3eebf8290a9d9558189cd91deadfeec7f267066d69b9e60085deb3b0cd4d","category":"Sites"}